  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Government Partnership MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objectives of the Trust Fund are:
 (a) to enhance the capacity of countries to develop and implement country-led commitments on open government;
 (b) to increase the expansion and dissemination of knowledge on the effectiveness and impact of open government reforms; and
 (c) to increase the policy dialogue on and operational support to open government reforms in the Bank.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
